OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Facross Scotland easing tonight,
OL,7,Fleaving many with a dry night and
OL,8,Fclear spells. Temperatures are lower
OL,9,Fthan last night, leading to a chillier
OL,10,Fnight away from the southeast. Rural
OL,11,Ftemperatures down in the low single
OL,12,Ffigures.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA few showers in Scotland,
OL,15,Fotherwise fine and dry with plenty of
OL,16,Fhazy sunshine in the south. Very warm
OL,17,Fhere, with cloud thickening in the
OL,18,Fwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
